      "id": 13,
      "symbol": "earlyDb",
      "name": "Early",
      "doc": "The early reflections' level, dB: the declared tap set (REVERB_EARLY_TAP_MS, REVERB_EARLY_TAP_GAINS) read from the pre-delayed feed, even taps on the left, odd on the right, beside the tail. The travel's floor is off, no early reflections at all, and is the come-up value, so a fresh reverb is the one that shipped, bit for bit.",
